# THE RALLY FLAG's marker (GameMatch::setRally): where the friendly barracks units gather instead of following the
# player. Render only: a gold light crystal floating 2.5 m over the flag's ground point (the origin), glowing (gemsGlow:
# unlit + Emissive, the bloom takes it). GameMatch also draws a gold ring on the ground around it.
Prefab gameRallyFlag
	Global true
	Component Render
		ObjectContainer gemsGlow
		Node Diamond
		Type StaticMesh
		Color 1 0.85 0.35
		Emissive 4
		Position 0 2.5 0
		Scale 0.6
